        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Phase 2 &mdash; The Cast</h1><p><em>Every named Phase 2 NPC with committed art, one to a page, alphabetical. Use it to put a face to a name mid-scene without opening four journals.</em></p><p><strong>Showing a face to the table.</strong> Click the portrait itself and use <em>Show Players</em> from the image popout &mdash; that shares the picture alone. Do <em>not</em> share the page: the text under each portrait is written for you, not for them.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Who</th><th>In one line</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Arthen Moll</strong></td><td>Deputy Voice of Civic Reconciliation.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Brell Kostan</strong></td><td>Yeomanry sergeant, twenty years in.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Doman Reith</strong></td><td>The party reaches him too late.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Doril Veth</strong></td><td>Tamsin Moraven's chief clerk at her counting house on Tannerway.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Halir Anwic</strong></td><td>Yeomanry sergeant who was on Tamsin Moraven's case until he was reassigned.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Merev Sarth</strong></td><td>Hired through three intermediaries by a paymaster the party will not be able to trace in Phase 2.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Merro Gilst</strong></td><td>Witness whose room is tossed during Phase 2 evidence-gathering.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Reln Pollow</strong></td><td>Contract-physician.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Rosalin Brent</strong></td><td>Mid-fifties; weathered; capable.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>\"Sparrow\" (Anla Coyle)</strong></td><td>Posted watcher on Wick Lane in the Phase 2 chase scene (Movement Two: The City, Scene 3d — The Sparrow's Run).</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tamsin Moraven</strong></td><td>Senior grain factor, Loftwick.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Trina Alvere</strong></td><td>Caelith Dunivar's private advisor.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Vellin Moraven</strong></td><td>Tamsin Moraven's husband.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Veshen Cindren</strong></td><td>Senior partner of Cindren &amp; Vhal in Greyhawk.</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgArthenMoll",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P2PortraitJr.BR2P2PoPgArthenMoll",
      "name": "Arthen Moll",
      "type": "text",
