        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Arthen Moll</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/arthen-moll-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Arthen Moll\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Deputy Voice of Civic Reconciliation. Mid-fifties, round, well-dressed in pearl-gray and dark blue, with a polished friendly smile. Visits the party with two clerks once they have identified at least two of the three names (Cindren &amp; Vhal, Gilst, Moraven) but before they choose a travel approach.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgBrellKosta",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P2PortraitJr.BR2P2PoPgBrellKosta",
      "name": "Brell Kostan",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": false,
