        "systemId": "dnd5e",
        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Doril Veth</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/doril-veth-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Doril Veth\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Tamsin Moraven's chief clerk at her counting house on Tannerway. Mid-fifties, methodical, has run her books for eleven years. Knows what the missing receipts mean and is afraid of saying so out loud.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
