      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Halir Anwic</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/halir-anwic-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Halir Anwic\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Yeomanry sergeant who was on Tamsin Moraven's case until he was reassigned. Approaches the party privately with what he was not allowed to write down. Senior to Brell Kostan, more cynical.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
