      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Merev Sarth</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/merev-sarth-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Merev Sarth\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Hired through three intermediaries by a paymaster the party will not be able to trace in Phase 2. Her contract is to retrieve or destroy the contents of the Strong Room, not to kill.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
