        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Merro Gilst</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/merro-gilst-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Merro Gilst\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Witness whose room is tossed during Phase 2 evidence-gathering. Identified in research; the party may track him for what he saw. Anxious, lives alone, keeps written copies of every receipt he ever signs.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
