      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Reln Pollow</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/reln-pollow-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Reln Pollow\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Contract-physician. Confronted at his office in three Phase 2 scenes. Forty, careful with his words, knows Tamsin's case from when he attended Doman in his last hour.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgRosalinBre",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P2PortraitJr.BR2P2PoPgRosalinBre",
