        "systemId": "dnd5e",
        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Rosalin Brent</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/rosalin-brent-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Rosalin Brent\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Mid-fifties; weathered; capable. Half-sister of Haskur Vandrell (same mother, different fathers). Runs the small roadhouse on the South Wool Road two days' ride south of Loftwick. NEW for Phase 2 sidequest — see the journal Phase 2 — Sidequest: The Sign of the Brown Hare.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgSparrowAnl",
