        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>\"Sparrow\" (Anla Coyle)</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/sparrow-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of \"Sparrow\" (Anla Coyle)\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Posted watcher on Wick Lane in the Phase 2 chase scene (Movement Two: The City, Scene 3d — The Sparrow's Run). Anla Coyle, about sixteen, wiry, watchful, a former message-runner thrown out of work when the little courier-house she ran for folded.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgTamsinMora",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P2PortraitJr.BR2P2PoPgTamsinMora",
