        "systemId": "dnd5e",
        "systemVersion": "5.3.0",
        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Tamsin Moraven</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/tamsin-moraven-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Tamsin Moraven\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Senior grain factor, Loftwick. Mid-fifties — tall, capable, dark hair gone iron-gray at the temples. Wears a dark green merchant's overdress, brass measuring key on a cord at her hip. Twelve years in independent trade; before that, she clerked for the Loftwick Treasury's Grain Office.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
    {
      "_id": "BR2P2PoPgTrinaAlver",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!BR2P2PortraitJr.BR2P2PoPgTrinaAlver",
