        "createdTime": null,
        "modifiedTime": null,
        "lastModifiedBy": null
      },
      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Trina Alvere</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/trina-alvere-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Trina Alvere\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Caelith Dunivar's private advisor. Patron of the arts in Loftwick. Mentor — quietly, without announcement — to Alicia. Looks mid-thirties; the arithmetic does not survive scrutiny. Pale. Silver-streaked dark hair worn long and braided. Wears soft fabrics in muted greens and grays. Speaks just loudly enough to be heard; people lean in to listen.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
    },
