      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Vellin Moraven</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/vellin-moraven-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Vellin Moraven\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Tamsin Moraven's husband. Potential hostage thread in Phase 2; at risk if the party moves too publicly. Forty, mild, manages the household while Tamsin runs the counting house.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
      }
