      "text": {
        "content": "<h1>Veshen Cindren</h1><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"modules/blooming-rot-2/assets/portraits/veshen-cindren-portrait.png\" alt=\"Portrait of Veshen Cindren\" style=\"max-width: 420px; border-radius: 4px;\"></p><p>Senior partner of Cindren &amp; Vhal in Greyhawk. Hosts the Festival of Lamps reception where the party may first encounter the firm's leadership. Cordial, evasive, careful.</p>",
        "format": 1,
        "markdown": null
